# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and must stay that way.
#
# Two categories, and the difference decides where each one may appear:
#
#   Server-only    Never reaches the app bundle. Read by server/index.mjs.
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_*  Inlined into the JavaScript by Expo, so anyone can read it.
#
# The deploy script strips EXPO_PUBLIC_*KEY from the web build and then greps
# the output to prove none leaked. The Supabase pair below is the one deliberate
# exception — see the note there.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Accounts (required for sign-in; without it the site offers only the demo)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# supabase.com -> new project -> SQL Editor -> paste supabase/schema.sql -> Run
# Then Settings -> API and copy these two values.
#
# The anon key is public by design. It is how an unauthenticated browser
# addresses the project; Row-Level Security is what protects the data. Never put
# the service_role / secret key here — it bypasses every policy, and the deploy
# script will refuse to build if it finds one.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live data feeds (all optional; each falls back to a labelled offline estimate)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Diesel prices by PADD region. Free: eia.gov/opendata/register.php
EIA_KEY=

# Truck-legal routing. Free tier: openrouteservice.org/dev/#/signup
# Server-side name is ORS_KEY. EXPO_PUBLIC_ORS_KEY exists for local development
# only and is stripped from the public web build.
ORS_KEY=
EXPO_PUBLIC_ORS_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Document scanning (server only — never prefix this with EXPO_PUBLIC_)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Read by server/index.mjs, which is the only holder. Run it with: npm run server
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Where the app sends documents for extraction. Without it, scanning falls back
# to the offline sample extractor and labels itself as such.
EXPO_PUBLIC_EXTRACT_URL=
